# pe_chain.mol — single 18-atom united-atom polyethylene chain template
# Geometry mirrors make_pe_box() in benchmarks/md/polyethylene_tension.cpp:
#   dy_step = r0 * cos((π-θ0)/2)   = 1.272798 Å
#   dz_step = r0 * sin((π-θ0)/2)   = 0.847247 Å
#   r0 = 1.529 Å, θ0 = 112.7°
# Atoms zig-zag along +y with z alternating between 0 and dz_step.
# Mass per atom = 14.027 amu (CH2 united atom; CH3 endpoints share same type).

